  id: rivia
  displayName: Chapter I — Rivia
  spawnPosition: {x: 2, y: 1.2, z: 0}
  triad: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a8c91d2e3f405162738495a6b7c8d9e0, type: 2}
  prologue: "There was a hero called Theo. Goddess Athena granted him a living book:
    at every milestone three sentences would be offered. He would keep one gift.
    The two he refused would curdle into wounds.\n\nHe was tasked to slay the Demon
    Lord tormenting the world. His journey began in the village of Rivia, where a
    demon pillar poisoned the wells. Athena opened the first page."
  deathLine: And Theo fell in Rivia. Athena turned the page back, but she did not
    erase the ink.
  tutorialText: A/D move. Space jump. Click or K to attack the pillar.
  spawnCell: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
